241
00:15:03,080 --> 00:15:07,080
We'll be behind you every step of the way, Captain!

242
00:15:08,080 --> 00:15:12,080
Thank you. All of you. I understand what needs to be done.

243
00:15:13,080 --> 00:15:16,080
At some point, I'm going to touch Yami.

244
00:15:16,080 --> 00:15:26,080
General, I love how cool and aloof you are. You're just like the magic knight Fiorel from the novel I'm reading. Fiorel is the ultimate hero because he can harness the powers of light, dark, flame, wind...

245
00:15:27,080 --> 00:15:29,080
All of those? That's just bad writing!

246
00:15:30,080 --> 00:15:32,080
So, look! It sounds like you're a really talented fighter.

247
00:15:33,080 --> 00:15:34,080
You want me to show you?

248
00:15:35,080 --> 00:15:37,080
Oh, wow. I didn't expect him to be that forward.

249
00:15:38,080 --> 00:15:42,080
From what I've heard about the Heart Kingdom, it must be a beautiful place. I'd love to see it someday.

250
00:15:43,080 --> 00:15:47,080
I'd be happy to take you there for a visit once this whole thing is over. We can take your siblings too.

251
00:15:48,080 --> 00:15:51,080
She's got nerve! If I let my guard down around her, she'll scoop them right up!

252
00:15:52,080 --> 00:15:53,080
Why did I hire this girl again?

253
00:15:53,080 --> 00:15:54,080
Noelle?

254
00:15:56,080 --> 00:16:03,080
Um, listen. So far, I don't really have any friends outside of the Black Bulls, so I would love to get acquainted with you.

255
00:16:04,080 --> 00:16:09,080
Oh, and I should probably mention my hobby is making dolls, so I hope it wouldn't bother you if I crafted one in your likeness, Miss Pooley.

256
00:16:10,080 --> 00:16:14,080
Oh, I'd be honored if you did! I'll even give you my measurements so it'll be an accurate depiction!

257
00:16:15,080 --> 00:16:16,080
Oh, great.

258
00:16:17,080 --> 00:16:20,080
There's no way I'll lose after the expert coaching I've had from Charmy!

259
00:16:20,080 --> 00:16:26,080
I can't exactly reach out and touch Yami out of nowhere. I'd better start with serving him food.

260
00:16:27,080 --> 00:16:29,080
Here, have some.

261
00:16:30,080 --> 00:16:35,080
Oh, thank you. He beat me to the punch! What am I supposed to do now?

262
00:16:35,080 --> 00:16:41,080
You sure were taking a dump for a long time. Oh, sorry, I mean, powdering your nose.

263
00:16:42,080 --> 00:16:47,080
Oh, crude! I needed to have a conversation with my subordinates, not that it's any of your business!

264
00:16:47,080 --> 00:16:52,080
Uh-huh. Guess that's why I keep seeing your Blue Rose girls sneaking back and forth.

265
00:16:53,080 --> 00:16:56,080
You noticed, then? Well, I suppose they were hard to miss.

266
00:16:57,080 --> 00:17:01,080
They're probably worried about you. We all know you can't hold your liquor.

267
00:17:01,080 --> 00:17:05,080
That's not... I mean, I certainly can't dispute that fact.

268
00:17:06,080 --> 00:17:10,080
Whether we're on a mission or not, the Blue Rose Knights always have my best interests at heart.

269
00:17:11,080 --> 00:17:14,080
They were the ones who arranged this dinner party tonight just for me.

270
00:17:15,080 --> 00:17:19,080
I tend to get so focused on fighting and being strong that I forget about everything else.

271
00:17:19,080 --> 00:17:22,080
So I end up relying on them.

272
00:17:23,080 --> 00:17:26,080
Oh no, I'm running my mouth when I should be listening to him!

273
00:17:27,080 --> 00:17:31,080
That's all right. You gotta learn how to lean on other people more.

274
00:17:35,080 --> 00:17:42,080
I depend on my squad. For dumps. Oh, I'm sorry. For powdering my nose, I have one of them make a portal for me so it's easier.

275
00:17:43,080 --> 00:17:44,080
Shouldn't you do that for yourself?

276
00:17:45,080 --> 00:17:48,080
You know, that meat's pretty good. You ought to try it with some pepper.

277
00:17:49,080 --> 00:17:50,080
All right.

278
00:17:59,080 --> 00:18:04,080
I feel Yami's hand on mine. Is this a casual touch?

279
00:18:12,080 --> 00:18:13,080
Captain!

280
00:18:14,080 --> 00:18:15,080
Shark!

281
00:18:15,080 --> 00:18:18,080
For crying out loud, you don't have to act like you just got infected with the damn plague or something.

282
00:18:18,080 --> 00:18:19,080
Can I keep my hands clean?

283
00:18:19,080 --> 00:18:21,080
I'm pretty sure that's not the problem.

284
00:18:22,080 --> 00:18:29,080
I want you to understand how great Fiorel is. I think we should have a reading party tonight. Just you and me all alone in my room.

285
00:18:30,080 --> 00:18:33,080
Nah, I'm good. I appreciate the offer, but that sort of thing isn't my scene.

286
00:18:33,080 --> 00:18:51,080
It's not fair! The one time a pretty girl actually looks my way at a mixer and here I am trying to be decent! Don't you dare touch her, Fiorel! I know you! As soon as you make physical contact, you're gonna go right back into ladies man mode! Stay strong, Fiorel! Please, we're almost home free!

287
00:18:51,080 --> 00:18:55,080
Hey, looks like he's already in a battle of his own. That kind of makes me jealous!

288
00:18:56,080 --> 00:18:58,080
You and I ought to fight too! Right here, right now!

289
00:18:59,080 --> 00:19:03,080
You seriously want us to do it in front of all these people? What kind of floozy do you think I am, mister?

290
00:19:03,080 --> 00:19:09,080
Come on! You can do it! Pull yourself away one muscle at a time! Just say no!

291
00:19:13,080 --> 00:19:15,080
Poor Fiorel. He looks like he's in pain.

292
00:19:19,080 --> 00:19:20,080
Captain Charlotte?

293
00:19:22,080 --> 00:19:23,080
I'll save you!

294
00:19:27,080 --> 00:19:30,080
Good evening, Captain. You look absolutely ravishing tonight.

295
00:19:33,080 --> 00:19:43,080
I know I just swooped in and saved you like some Prince Charming, but I didn't have a single ulterior motive for my actions. My heart already belongs to someone else and it always will!

296
00:19:44,080 --> 00:19:45,080
Fiorel!

297
00:19:45,080 --> 00:19:46,080
You're kidding.

298
00:19:48,080 --> 00:19:50,080
Wow, I didn't know we were having that kind of party.

299
00:19:52,080 --> 00:19:54,080
Get your hands off me now!

300
00:19:56,080 --> 00:20:00,080
I was fooling myself. The ideal man only exists in storybooks, not real life.

301
00:20:00,080 --> 00:20:09,080
Your aggressive behavior tonight made me realize something. If I'm too focused on getting married, I'll probably end up with a brute like you and hate my life. Goodbye!

302
00:20:09,080 --> 00:20:21,080
I brought us here in disguise so we could keep an eye on my brother since he mentioned something about training to get over his curse. But I guess he was just being his normal stupid self and there was nothing to see. I'm sorry.

303
00:20:21,080 --> 00:20:22,080
I'm sorry.

304
00:20:22,080 --> 00:20:34,080
No. Actually, I'm really thankful I was able to be here for this, Longris. It's true, Finral does have a strong interest in women, but he's also very kind and I think that's one of the ways he expresses it.

305
00:20:35,080 --> 00:20:38,080
You can call him kind. I call him a girl crazy loser.

306
00:20:39,080 --> 00:20:41,080
Anyway, we should head home.

307
00:20:41,080 --> 00:20:44,080
I didn't know you guys had jobs here.

308
00:20:44,080 --> 00:20:46,080
Yeah, what are the odds, right?

309
00:20:46,080 --> 00:20:47,080
Small world.

310
00:20:47,080 --> 00:20:54,080
Yep, it's a total coincidence. You should try being a bit more forward with Asta. We both know he isn't too bright.

311
00:20:54,080 --> 00:20:55,080
What?!

312
00:20:55,080 --> 00:20:59,080
I don't know what you're talking about! I don't have anything to say to his dumb face! No way!

313
00:20:59,080 --> 00:21:10,080
I'm sorry, Asta. I dragged you out here to help me train, and then I kept screwing things up. Just forget it. I'll never be good enough.

314
00:21:10,080 --> 00:21:14,080
Come on, you can't throw in the towel yet, Finral? This is only the beginning, okay?

315
00:21:15,080 --> 00:21:16,080
Thanks, Asta.

316
00:21:17,080 --> 00:21:25,080
Well, I can't say I've ever seen you in a situation like that before. So, is that the kind of guy you like? A dashing young hero?

317
00:21:25,080 --> 00:21:31,080
Don't be ridiculous. That fool could never obtain my love. My heart is spoken for by someone important to me.

318
00:21:31,080 --> 00:21:33,080
Oh, you don't have to tell me that.

319
00:21:37,080 --> 00:21:40,080
Your heart belongs to your squad. You've said it a million times.

320
00:21:42,080 --> 00:21:44,080
Are you okay there?

321
00:21:45,080 --> 00:21:48,080
Looks like you still need some help from your angel of love!

322
00:21:48,080 --> 00:21:49,080
Oh!

323
00:21:49,080 --> 00:21:51,080
Ah! Ah! Ah! Ah!

324
00:21:54,080 --> 00:21:55,080
He's so close...

325
00:21:55,080 --> 00:21:58,080
Well, let's do our best to get along for six months alright?

326
00:22:00,080 --> 00:22:01,080
Yes...

327
00:22:01,080 --> 00:22:12,080
It's not a bad thing, but it's not a bad thing.

328
00:22:12,080 --> 00:22:18,080
You always say that I'm laughing.

329
00:22:18,080 --> 00:22:25,080
If you take your hand, you'll be able to reach the same way.

330
00:22:25,080 --> 00:22:29,080
I won't be able to do anything.

331
00:22:29,080 --> 00:22:35,080
I'll be able to walk and walk.

332
00:22:35,080 --> 00:22:43,080
You'll be able to leave the same way.

333
00:22:43,080 --> 00:22:48,080
I'll be able to change the same way.

334
00:22:48,080 --> 00:22:52,080
I'll be able to change the same way.

335
00:22:52,080 --> 00:22:56,080
I don't need to be able to change the same way.

336
00:22:56,080 --> 00:23:02,080
I'll be able to change the same way.

337
00:23:02,080 --> 00:23:04,080
I'll be able to change the same way.

338
00:23:04,080 --> 00:23:08,080
I'll be able to change the same way.

339
00:23:08,080 --> 00:23:11,080
I'll respond along the second thing.

340
00:23:11,080 --> 00:23:14,080
The same way you want to change the same way.

341
00:23:14,080 --> 00:23:15,080
I'll be able to change the same way.

342
00:23:15,080 --> 00:23:21,080
I'll be able to change the same way.

343
00:23:21,080 --> 00:23:22,080
You are the only one of those who are fresh!

344
00:23:22,080 --> 00:23:27,080
You've never seen me where this guy's all over.

345
00:23:27,080 --> 00:23:31,080
I'm not one here anymore.

